   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "widgets_values": [
    "HaDeS MOSS Suite - Two Stages, Two Models (advanced)\n\n1. Base + Turbo 8-steps v1.0 (8 steps, CFG 1) makes the picture: the scene and the person.\n2. SFT + Turbo 8-steps v0.7 redraws Base's latent at denoise 0.3, denoise_mode exact: the same\n   person, with SFT's skin texture, pores and wrinkles, a little warmer (stage 1 shows in the Preview).\n\nMeasured (tools/RESULTS.md), two neutral prompts x 16 seeds, ArcFace identity against Base's image:\n  denoise 0.3: 0.80 (cafe woman) / 0.90 (fisherman portrait), every one of the 32 the same person;\n  0.5: 0.66 / 0.85; 0.7: 0.51 / 0.73, faces start to turn into SFT's (eye colour, face shape).\nSo the people are Base's. East Asian faces, counted by eye on these two prompts (no ethnicity named):\n  SFT alone about 14 / 16 and 16 / 16, Base alone and this workflow at 0.3 about 4 / 16 and 4 / 16.\nNaming who you want in the prompt stays the reliable way.\nRaise denoise for more of SFT, lower it to keep more of Base. About 6 s an image warm on an RTX 5090\n(23 s the first time, both models loading). Telemetry's note on the turbo at denoise 0.30 refers to\nits older measurements; this one is in RESULTS.\n\nModels: SFT and Base in models/diffusion_models, both turbo LoRAs in models/loras (download links in the nodes)."
   ],
   "properties": {}
  }
